== Trivia ==
* The portal spawned by Lil Portal bears a close resemblance to the {{E|Lil Portal}} enemies.
* {{dlc|r+}} Internally, the special room Lil Portal leads to is just a copy of the default starting room with customized look and contents. 
** Lil Portal also does not 'teleport' Isaac to another room location, the special room is generated overtop of the current room.

